[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m a call hierarchy, and the table drives the **low-level ones directly**, not
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m just the `driver()` one-shot wrapper:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | level | entry point | callees |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m |-------|-------------|---------|
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | L0 (leaf) | `printLine(const char*)`      | `printf`/`puts` |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | L0 (leaf) | `printIntLine(int)`           | `printf` |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | L1        | `bad(float)`                 | `printIntLine` |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | L1        | `good(float)`                | `goodG2B` (static) -> `printIntLine`; `goodB2G` (static) -> `printIntLine` / `printLine` |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | L2 (top)  | `driver(float, float)`       | `printLine` x4, `good`, `bad` |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `goodG2B` / `goodB2G` are `static`, so they are only reachable through `good()`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m and `driver()` — rows 20+ exist specifically to exercise that composed pipeline.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ### Axis 2 — runtime options / modes / flags
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **There are none.** Exhaustive check:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ```sh
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    30[0m:[38;5;10m[49m grep -nE "#if|#ifdef|#ifndef|switch|extern .*=|static .*=|getenv" c_src/src/driver.c
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    31[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ```
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    32[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    33[0m:[38;5;10m[49m finds no preprocessor configuration, no globals, no setters, no mode enums, no
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    34[0m:[38;5;10m[49m environment lookups. The library is stateless: output depends only on the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m arguments of the current call. `driver.h`'s single `#ifndef DRIVER_H_` is an
