[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    38[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The one piece of *implicit* shared state is libc's `stdout` buffer, which both
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `.so`s write into — so **call ordering / interleaving** is treated as an axis
